# LV3PartyPrivateMonster (27261, level 76), raised as the private of a master: the character's hit
# adds a tenth-scale attack desire (10 over level 76 + 7, times 10); a private spawned with no master
# at all keeps no spawn parameters, so the character's hit leaves it out of the world; and when its
# master dies, the private leaves too.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.LV3Monster.LV3Monster
script script.ai.individual.Monster.LV3Monster.LV3PartyPrivateMonster
npc owner 20003 Monster 600 0 0 params 0 character 0
npc priv 27261 Monster 300 0 0 level 76 master owner
npc lone 27261 Monster 300 300 0 level 76

hit priv 10
  desires priv attack(player)=35.9802847754655
  inworld lone yes
hit lone 10
  S DeleteObject obj=lone
  inworld lone no
kill owner
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S DeleteObject obj=priv
  inworld priv no
